&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Separate from blog &lt;strong&gt;posts&lt;/strong&gt;. Use it for typed image collections, structured metadata, and Drive-hosted images (no large files in Git).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Open &lt;strong&gt;Catalog&lt;/strong&gt; in the menu: &lt;code&gt;/catalog/&lt;/code&gt; (with language prefixes, e.g. &lt;code&gt;/zh-tw/catalog/&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>